{
  "description": "/v1/responses 请求体 schema（复用 pydantic，零新依赖，非法载荷直接 400）。\n\ninput 为消息数组、stream 为布尔、previous_response_id 为会话标识；\nrequest_id 为幂等键（§4.7）：同 id 重复提交由 serve 重放首次结果，避免重复烧 token/写库。\nproject_id（P0-2/OPT-107）：Project 长期任务空间——服务端据此注入项目规则/背景\n（<vault>/ark/projects/<id>/）；非法或不存在 → 静默降级为全局行为。\n其余字段（如前端 Hermes 兼容的 model/tools）放行忽略，不做强校验以免破坏现有客户端。",
  "properties": {
    "input": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "items": {
            "additionalProperties": true,
            "type": "object"
          },
          "type": "array"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "title": "Input"
    },
    "stream": {
      "default": true,
      "title": "Stream",
      "type": "boolean"
    },
    "previous_response_id": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "title": "Previous Response Id"
    },
    "request_id": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "title": "Request Id"
    },
    "project_id": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "title": "Project Id"
    },
    "multi": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "type": "array"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "title": "Multi"
    }
  },
  "title": "ResponsesRequest",
  "type": "object"
}
